rl767I02RsIU0z7B01BIp52RpJZaOd1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1phG1fSFBDv5wFj8kpYLrIaJCj0a1YKauP20v5fNgAg&oe=6B030ABC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "jousting-oculuszdjecie-w-tle.png", "id": "1101975417031636", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_1101975420364969_4891128562063501818_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C5xTKVq8O4oQ7kNvwH6W72j&_nc_oc=AdrdSH7q1Q3EUzmptdWgxfP-pZ7GVYDGDWOYQCznua6KVjIN9pmf0_fq6Zp7_65EXxs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUaZ98rkM1P7jcJ23vPxKaaCtWXHY5FvXee9iO7yAEsg&oe=6B0323C4"}, "display_name": "Jousting VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "XIII century, Europe, royal market courtyard. You are a knight who joined the medieval tournament. Your task is \"simple\". Jump on your trusty steed, grab your lance & defeat the enemy. Take into consideration speed, accuracy, strength. Equipment is also important. The better gear the easier the task.  Oh, and other knights - they want to win as much as you do.\n\nYou beat them the king's greatest treasure is yours. And I didn't mean gold.\n\nJOUSTING VR FEATURES\n\n- Physics - experience Exciting fights based on true lance fighting physics.\n- Progression -  Knightly tournaments in which only the best advance to the next stages.\n- Challenge mode -  Smash hanging items. An exceptional aim helps you hit the target.", "short_description": "Welcome to medieval times. Times of Jousting.\nYou take part in a grand tournament competing with other knights, for fame, glory, wealth and to win the king's niece's heart.\n\u201cTo risk life to save a smile on a face of a woman or a child is the secret of chivalry.\u201d"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vraar.pl/privacy_policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vraar S.A.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": 